 "descripcion": "From a buried shipping container to a real fallout shelter: why containers get crushed, why every 3.5 inches of dirt halves the radiation, and why the entrance always turns a corner.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #bunker #falloutshelter #howitworks #shorts",
